{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52366","headline":"回波乐 九 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心本无双无只（陈校作「佞」），深难到底渊洪。\n无来无去不住，㺃（陈校作「犹」、任校作「独」）如法性虚空。\n复能出生诸法，不迟不疾容（任改作「从」）容。\n幸愿诸人思忖（原作「恃」，从项校改），自然法性通同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}